# Lab-only SSH configuration for the Phase 6B failed-authentication simulation.
# Password authentication is enabled solely so known-wrong credentials can create
# server-side evidence. The disposable account password is generated at startup.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
AllowUsers socops

MaxAuthTries 1
LoginGraceTime 15
LogLevel VERBOSE
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
